# Dexter's Lab crontab template (Linux, or macOS if you prefer cron).
#
# REPLACE every __PLACEHOLDER__ before installing:
#   __LAB_REPO__   absolute path to your dexters-lab clone
#                  (example: /home/yourname/dexters-lab)
#   __LAB_HOME__   absolute path to your lab_home (see lab.config.json;
#                  default is ~/dexters-lab-home, written out in full)
#
# Install: crontab -e, then paste the lines you want.
#
# Note: cron ships a minimal PATH. The lab scripts export the common bin
# dirs themselves, but if your claude CLI lives somewhere unusual, set
# PATH here too, for example:
# PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin

# Nightly task executor at 03:30 (one ledger task per run)
30 3 * * * /bin/bash __LAB_REPO__/bin/lab_executor.sh >> __LAB_HOME__/cron.executor.log 2>&1

# Nightly literature scan at 04:15 (one queue target per run)
15 4 * * * /bin/bash __LAB_REPO__/bin/lab_lit.sh >> __LAB_HOME__/cron.lit.log 2>&1
